{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04963","headline":"明冰篇 · 富嘉谟","name":"明冰篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北陆苍茫河海凝，南山阑干昼夜冰。\n素彩峨峨明月升，深山穷谷不自见。\n安知采斵备嘉荐，阴房涸冱掩寒扇。\n阳春二月朝始暾，春光潭沱度千门。\n明冰时出御至尊，彤庭赫赫九仪备。\n腰玉煌煌千官事，明冰毕赋周在位。\n忆昨沙漠寒风涨，崑仑长河冰始壮。\n漫汗崚嶒积亭障，噰噰鸣雁江上来。\n禁苑池台冰复开，摇青涵绿映楼台。\n豳歌七月王风始，凿冰藏用昭物轨，四时不忒千万祀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"富嘉谟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04963.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04963","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}